        }
      }
    },
    "It came by a path this source does not accept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elle est arrivée par un chemin que cette source n’accepte pas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It can take information from the internet without reading it. No source goes through it yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il peut recevoir des informations depuis internet sans pouvoir les lire. Aucune source ne passe encore par lui."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It changes the files of its folder. Anything else, like installing or running a program, is refused, and Maé tells you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il modifie les fichiers de son dossier. Le reste, comme installer ou lancer un programme, est refusé, et Maé te le dit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It decides alone what is safe to do on this Mac, without asking you. Choose this only if you trust it with your files.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il décide seul de ce qu’il peut faire sans risque sur ce Mac, sans te demander. Ne choisis ce mode que si tu lui confies tes fichiers en toute confiance."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is kept in your Mac’s keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il est gardé dans le trousseau de ton Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It took over 10 seconds to arrive.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elle a mis plus de 10 secondes à arriver."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It will no longer be able to talk to Maé, and its conversation in progress closes. To add it again, you will have to scan a new code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il ne pourra plus parler à Maé, et sa conversation en cours se ferme. Pour le remettre, il faudra scanner un nouveau code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It works: %lld actions in %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ça marche : %lld actions en %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It works: %lld results in %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ça marche : %lld résultats en %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It works: one result in %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ça marche : un résultat en %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its address stops working at once, and its last deliveries are erased.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son adresse cesse aussitôt de marcher, et ses dernières informations sont effacées."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son dossier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep for": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Garder pendant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep for later": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Garder pour plus tard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep past conversations": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Garder les conversations passées"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep past conversations for": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Garder les conversations passées pendant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep this Mac awake when plugged in": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Garder ce Mac éveillé sur secteur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept for later": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gardée pour plus tard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept in your Mac’s keychain. Create a key on Brave’s website if you want to change it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rangée dans le trousseau de ton Mac. Crée une clé sur le site de Brave si tu veux la changer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Language model": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modèle de langage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Language model of the %@ tier": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modèle de langage du palier %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last actions": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dernières actions"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last delivery: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dernier envoi : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last incident": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dernier incident"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last information": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dernières informations"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last turn": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dernier tour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Latest step": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dernière étape"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave it empty to keep the saved token. It is kept in your Mac’s keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Laisse-le vide pour garder le jeton enregistré. Il est gardé dans le trousseau de ton Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Limit reached": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Limite atteinte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listening": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Écoute"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loading speech recognition…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chargement de la reconnaissance vocale…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loading the language model…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chargement du modèle de langage…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loading the voice…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chargement de la voix…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MCP is an open standard: a tool that speaks it gives Maé new actions. Choose how this one connects.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MCP est un standard ouvert : un outil qui le parle donne à Maé de nouvelles actions. Choisis comment celui-ci se connecte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maximum": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maximum"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maximum (48 GB and more)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maximum (48 Go et plus)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "May ask for an urgent announcement": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Peut demander une annonce urgente"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé acts as soon as you ask, without waiting for your “yes”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé agit dès que tu le demandes, sans attendre ton « oui »."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé adds events and reminders, reads your calendar, sets timers and runs the shortcuts of the “OpenMaé” folder in the Shortcuts app. She tells you what she saved: say “cancel” to take it back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé ajoute des événements et des rappels, lit ton agenda, lance des minuteurs et les raccourcis du dossier « OpenMaé » de l’app Raccourcis. Elle te dit ce qu’elle a enregistré : dis « annule » pour revenir en arrière."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé answers as soon as she hears someone speak.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé répond dès qu’elle entend quelqu’un parler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé answers sentences that start with “OK Maé”, then listens a few seconds more. The TV on hinders her; plugged in, this Mac no longer sleeps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé répond aux phrases qui commencent par « OK Maé », puis t’écoute encore quelques secondes. La télé allumée la gêne ; sur secteur, ce Mac ne se met plus en veille."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé can remember what you tell her, from one conversation to the next. Everything stays on your Mac, in a folder of its own, and never goes to the internet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé peut retenir ce que tu lui dis, d’une conversation à l’autre. Tout reste sur ton Mac, dans un dossier à part, et ne passe jamais par internet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé can’t use them. Allow OpenMaé in System Settings, Privacy & Security.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé ne peut pas s’en servir. Autorise OpenMaé dans Réglages Système, Confidentialité et sécurité."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé gives you the weather, the rate of a currency or a crypto, and travel times, through dedicated services.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé te donne la météo, le cours d’une devise ou d’une crypto et les temps de trajet grâce à des services dédiés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé hands long tasks to an agent: a website, code, research. It works on its own, and a notification tells you when it is done.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé confie les tâches longues à un agent : un site, du code, une recherche. Il travaille de son côté, et une notification te prévient quand c’est fini."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé has kept nothing yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé n’a encore rien gardé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé is answering": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé répond"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé is on your iPad": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé est sur ton iPad"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé is on your iPhone": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé est sur ton iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé is speaking": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé parle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé is thinking…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé réfléchit…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé keeps it without a word, and reads it when you ask “What’s new?”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé la garde sans rien dire, et la lit quand tu demandes « Quoi de neuf ? »."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé looks up what she can’t know by herself, on the web or from dedicated services. What you ask goes only to the engine or the service that answers it; the rest of the conversation stays on your Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé va chercher ce qu’elle ne peut pas savoir seule, sur le web ou auprès de services dédiés. Ce que tu demandes part seulement chez le moteur ou le service qui y répond ; le reste de la conversation reste sur ton Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé runs the shortcut as soon as you ask for it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé lance le raccourci dès que tu le demandes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé says nothing on her own: everything is kept for later, and urgent announcements also show a notification. Ask her “What’s new?” to hear it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé ne dit plus rien d’elle-même : tout est gardé pour plus tard, et les annonces urgentes s’affichent aussi en notification. Demande-lui « Quoi de neuf ? » pour l’entendre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé says what your sources send as it arrives, as each source’s mode says.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé dit ce que tes sources envoient dès que ça arrive, selon le mode de chaque source."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé says “%@”": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé dit « %@ »"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé searches the web with the engine you choose: the news, a score, opening hours, a price.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé cherche sur le web avec le moteur que tu choisis : l’actualité, un score, des horaires, un prix."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé sends the task at once. Say “cancel” right after to stop it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé envoie la tâche tout de suite. Dis « annule » juste après pour l’arrêter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé tells you what she is about to send and waits for your “yes”. The whole instruction is in the history.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé te dit ce qu’elle va envoyer et attend ton « oui ». La consigne complète est dans l’historique."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé uses a tool only if what you ask needs it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé n’utilise un outil que si ta demande en a besoin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé will no longer be able to search with Brave until you paste a key again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé ne pourra plus chercher avec Brave tant que tu n’auras pas collé une nouvelle clé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé will no longer be able to speak until you download them again (%@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé ne pourra plus parler tant que tu ne les auras pas téléchargés de nouveau (%@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Maé will no longer be able to use it, and its log is erased. You can add it again later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maé ne pourra plus s’en servir, et son journal est effacé. Tu pourras le rajouter plus tard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Meanwhile, what should be said right away is kept for later. Urgent announcements are still said.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pendant ces heures, ce qui devait être dit tout de suite est gardé pour plus tard. Les annonces urgentes sont quand même dites."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measurements (latency of each stage)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mesures (latence de chaque étape)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Median latency": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Latence médiane"
          }
        }
      }
    },
