            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Test en cours…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The OpenMaé relay in home mode, on a machine at home. Type the address it listens on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le relais OpenMaé en mode maison, sur une machine de la maison. Tape l’adresse où il écoute."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The OpenMaé relay, run in home mode on a machine at home (a NAS, a Raspberry Pi…). It passes on what your systems send: this Mac opens no port.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le relais OpenMaé, lancé en mode maison sur une machine de la maison (un NAS, un Raspberry Pi…). Il transmet ce que tes systèmes envoient : ce Mac n’ouvre aucun port."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The address appears once the home relay is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’adresse apparaît une fois le relais maison activé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The address appears once the internet relay answers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’adresse apparaît dès que le relais internet répond."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The address appears once the internet relay is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’adresse apparaît une fois le relais internet activé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The address is not ready yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’adresse n’est pas encore prête."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assistant runs entirely on this Mac, without the Internet. It first needs its models: one download, and the connection is not used any more.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’assistant fonctionne entièrement sur ce Mac, sans Internet. Il lui faut d’abord ses modèles : un seul téléchargement, et la connexion ne sert plus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assistant stops and its models are erased from this Mac. To use it again, they will have to be downloaded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’assistant s’arrête et ses modèles sont effacés de ce Mac. Pour s’en servir à nouveau, il faudra les télécharger."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assistant will restart with %@, already on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’assistant va redémarrer avec %@, déjà sur ce Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assistant will restart with %@. If it is not on this Mac yet, it will have to be downloaded (%@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’assistant va redémarrer avec %@. S’il n’est pas encore sur ce Mac, il faudra le télécharger (%@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The assistant will restart with %@. It has to be downloaded first (%@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’assistant va redémarrer avec %1$@. Il faut d’abord le télécharger (%2$@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The code works only once and stays between this Mac and your device: the relay cannot read it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le code ne marche qu’une fois et reste entre ce Mac et ton appareil : le relais ne peut pas le lire."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection of %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La connexion de %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The conversation goes on on your iPad until you take over.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La conversation continue sur ton iPad tant que tu ne reprends pas la main."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The conversation goes on on your iPhone until you take over.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La conversation continue sur ton iPhone tant que tu ne reprends pas la main."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The conversation will appear here": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La conversation s’affichera ici"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine did not start": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le moteur n’a pas démarré"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first launch can take a minute or two.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le premier lancement peut prendre une à deux minutes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The home relay does not answer: what your systems send cannot reach Maé. I keep trying.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le relais maison ne répond pas : ce que tes systèmes envoient ne peut pas arriver jusqu’à Maé. Je réessaie toute seule."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The internet relay does not answer: what is sent from the internet cannot reach Maé. I keep trying.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le relais internet ne répond pas : ce qui est envoyé depuis internet ne peut pas arriver jusqu’à Maé. Je réessaie toute seule."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone is blocked": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le micro est bloqué"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone or the speakers could not be opened. Check that they are connected, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le micro ou les haut-parleurs n’ont pas pu être ouverts. Vérifie qu’ils sont branchés, puis réessaie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model server (Hugging Face) refuses a file (error %@). The app probably needs an update.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le serveur des modèles (Hugging Face) refuse un fichier (erreur %@). Il faudra probablement une mise à jour de l’app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model “%@”, which ships with the app, cannot be found: the app is probably damaged. Reinstall it from its disk image.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le modèle « %@ », livré avec l’app, est introuvable : l’app est sans doute abîmée. Réinstalle-la depuis son image disque."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The models are not touched, and deleting the models never erases the memory.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les modèles ne sont pas touchés, et supprimer les modèles n’efface jamais la mémoire."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The models are saved in %@. You can quit the app during the download: it will resume where it stopped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les modèles sont enregistrés dans %@. Tu peux quitter l’app pendant le téléchargement : il reprendra là où il s’est arrêté."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The models could not be saved on the disk.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Impossible d’enregistrer les modèles sur le disque."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The models that run Maé on this Mac, and what she notes for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les modèles qui font tourner Maé sur ce Mac, et ce qu’elle note pour toi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new key replaces the old one in your Mac’s keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La nouvelle clé remplace l’ancienne dans le trousseau de ton Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The old address stops working at once: you will have to paste the new one in the other system.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’ancienne adresse cesse aussitôt de marcher : il faudra coller la nouvelle dans l’autre système."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server refused the user name or the password. Check them, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le serveur a refusé l’identifiant ou le mot de passe. Vérifie-les, puis réessaie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The source was paused: its address answered as if it did not exist.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La source était en pause : son adresse a répondu comme si elle n’existait pas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tier decides the language model. “Automatic” picks the one that suits this Mac's memory.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le palier décide du modèle de langage. « Automatique » choisit celui qui convient à la mémoire de ce Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tool did not answer in time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’outil n’a pas répondu à temps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tool refused: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’outil a refusé : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tool refuses the access: check the token.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’outil refuse l’accès : vérifie le jeton."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thinking": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réflexion"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac asks Let’s Encrypt for the certificate that keeps deliveries encrypted up to it. It takes a few seconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce Mac demande à Let’s Encrypt le certificat qui garde les envois chiffrés jusqu’à lui. Ça prend quelques secondes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac could not get its certificate yet: what is sent from the internet cannot reach Maé. I try again later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce Mac n’a pas encore pu obtenir son certificat : ce qui est envoyé depuis internet ne peut pas arriver jusqu’à Maé. Je réessaie plus tard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac is not supported": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce Mac n’est pas compatible"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This address can’t be one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette adresse ne peut pas en être une."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This address doesn’t answer like a SearXNG (code %lld).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette adresse ne répond pas comme un SearXNG (code %lld)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This address doesn’t answer like a SearXNG.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette adresse ne répond pas comme un SearXNG."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This code expired": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce code a expiré"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This conversation": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette conversation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This frees %@ on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cela libère %@ sur ce Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This frees %@ on this Mac. If you choose the %@ tier later, it will be downloaded again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cela libère %1$@ sur ce Mac. Si tu choisis plus tard le palier %2$@, il sera téléchargé de nouveau."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is not an address. Type it like 192.168.1.10:8080.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce n’est pas une adresse. Écris-la sous la forme 192.168.1.10:8080."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is not an address. Type it like relay.example.org.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce n’est pas une adresse. Écris-la sous la forme relay.example.org."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This program runs on your Mac with your rights. Only add programs you know.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce programme tourne sur ton Mac avec tes droits. N’ajoute que des programmes que tu connais."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This relay is not in home mode, so it passes nothing on to Maé. Start it with RELAY_HOME_INBOUND=true.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce relais n’est pas en mode maison, il ne transmet donc rien à Maé. Lance-le avec RELAY_HOME_INBOUND=true."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This tier could not be tested: performance is estimated.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce palier n’a pas pu être testé : les performances sont estimées."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This tier needs more memory than this Mac has: the assistant may be very slow.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce palier demande plus de mémoire que ce Mac n’en a : l’assistant risque d’être très lent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Those switched on below ask first: Maé says which one she is about to run and waits for your “yes”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ceux qui sont allumés ci-dessous demandent d’abord : Maé dit lequel elle va lancer et attend ton « oui »."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tier": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Palier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To download": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À télécharger"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To hear you, the assistant needs the microphone. Allow it in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Microphone, then come back here. Sound never leaves this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour t’entendre, l’assistant a besoin du micro. Autorise-le dans Réglages Système › Confidentialité et sécurité › Micro, puis reviens ici. Le son ne quitte jamais ce Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To look at": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À regarder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To reconnect": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À reconnecter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To set up": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À régler"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Token": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeton"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tokens already in memory": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mots déjà en mémoire"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tokens computed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mots calculés"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too late: kept for later": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trop tard : gardée pour plus tard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too many deliveries: at most 6 a minute and 60 an hour.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trop d’envois : 6 par minute et 60 par heure au plus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcription": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcription"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try again": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réessayer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn off": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Éteindre"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allumer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activer %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Claude Code": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activer Claude Code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn the actions on to choose the permissions and the shortcuts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Active les actions pour choisir les autorisations et les raccourcis."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turns": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tours"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type the address of your SearXNG first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tape d’abord l’adresse de ton SearXNG."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unexpected answer": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réponse inattendue"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlimited": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans limite"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unreachable": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Injoignable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Untested tier: performance is estimated.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Palier non testé : performances estimées."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Urgent information is said at once, whatever the mode, without cutting you off. If Maé can’t speak, a notification shows it and she keeps it for “What’s new?”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une information urgente est dite aussitôt, quel que soit le mode, sans te couper. Si Maé ne peut pas parler, une notification l’affiche et elle la garde pour « Quoi de neuf ? »."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used by": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilisé par"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "User name": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Identifiant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Valid for another": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Valable encore"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voix"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice and sound": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voix et son"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice cut after (median)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voix coupée en (médiane)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voice dropouts": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coupures de la voix"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En attente"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for your yes": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Attend ton oui"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weather data by Open-Meteo.com (CC BY 4.0). Rates of the European Central Bank, through Frankfurter. Crypto prices by CoinGecko. Travel times by Apple Maps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Données météo d’Open-Meteo.com (CC BY 4.0). Taux de la Banque centrale européenne, par Frankfurter. Cours des cryptomonnaies par CoinGecko. Temps de trajet par Plans d’Apple."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weather, rates and travel times": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Météo, cours et trajets"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Web search": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recherche sur le web"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What Claude Code may do": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que Claude Code peut faire"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What Maé can do": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que Maé peut faire"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What Maé does": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que fait Maé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What Maé noted of the sentences she heard is erased from this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que Maé a noté des phrases entendues est effacé de ce Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What Maé remembers": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que Maé retient"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What Maé remembers and the past conversations she keeps are erased from this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que Maé retient et les conversations passées qu’elle garde sont effacés de ce Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What it may do": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qu’il peut faire"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What she heard": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qu’elle a entendu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What went wrong": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qui n’a pas marché"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you hand it leaves this Mac: Claude Code works with Anthropic’s online models.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que tu lui confies quitte ce Mac : Claude Code travaille avec les modèles en ligne d’Anthropic."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What your systems send goes through it to this Mac, which opens no port. Never make it reachable from the internet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que tes systèmes envoient passe par lui jusqu’à ce Mac, qui n’ouvre aucun port. Ne le rends jamais joignable depuis internet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When Maé acts": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand Maé agit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When information arrives": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand une info arrive"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When she acts": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand elle agit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the search isn’t enough, she can open a website to read the details there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand la recherche ne suffit pas, elle peut ouvrir un site pour y lire le détail."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While it is paused, its address answers as if it did not exist.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tant qu’elle est en pause, son adresse répond comme si elle n’existait pas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With a token": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avec un jeton"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With headphones there is no echo, so the microphone is used as is. Avoid this mode with speakers: Maé would interrupt herself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avec un casque, il n’y a pas d’écho : le micro est utilisé tel quel. Évite ce mode sur les haut-parleurs, Maé se couperait la parole."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With my account": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avec mon compte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without a key, Maé can’t search. Create a key on Brave’s website, then paste it here: it is kept in your Mac’s keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans clé, Maé ne peut pas chercher. Crée une clé sur le site de Brave, puis colle-la ici : elle est rangée dans le trousseau de ton Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Woke up": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réveillée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wrong method: send with POST, or GET with ?text=.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mauvaise méthode : envoie avec POST, ou GET avec ?text=."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can now talk to Maé from your iPad, at home and away. Keep this Mac on and plugged in so that it stays reachable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu peux maintenant parler à Maé depuis ton iPad, à la maison comme ailleurs. Garde ce Mac allumé et branché pour qu’il reste joignable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can now talk to Maé from your iPad, at home. Keep this Mac on and plugged in so that it stays reachable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu peux maintenant parler à Maé depuis ton iPad, à la maison. Garde ce Mac allumé et branché pour qu’il reste joignable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can now talk to Maé from your iPhone, at home and away. Keep this Mac on and plugged in so that it stays reachable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu peux maintenant parler à Maé depuis ton iPhone, à la maison comme ailleurs. Garde ce Mac allumé et branché pour qu’il reste joignable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can now talk to Maé from your iPhone, at home. Keep this Mac on and plugged in so that it stays reachable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu peux maintenant parler à Maé depuis ton iPhone, à la maison. Garde ce Mac allumé et branché pour qu’il reste joignable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can remove it whenever you want.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu pourras le retirer quand tu veux."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You need a Mac with Apple silicon (M1 or later) and at least 8 GB of memory. This Mac: %@, %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il faut un Mac avec une puce Apple (M1 ou plus récente) et au moins 8 Go de mémoire. Ce Mac : %@, %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your %@ account": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton compte %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Brave key has reached its limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta clé Brave a atteint sa limite."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Mac has turned off its microphone and speakers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton Mac a coupé son micro et ses haut-parleurs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your SearXNG asks for a user name and a password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton SearXNG demande un identifiant et un mot de passe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your SearXNG doesn’t accept programs: turn on its JSON format.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton SearXNG n’accepte pas les programmes : active son format JSON."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your SearXNG takes OpenMaé for a robot: protect it with a password and turn off its bot protection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton SearXNG prend OpenMaé pour un robot : protège-le par un mot de passe et coupe sa protection anti-robots."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your iPhone and iPad reach this Mac at home only, and no source can send from the internet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton iPhone et ton iPad ne joignent ce Mac qu’à la maison, et aucune source ne peut envoyer depuis internet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your iPhone or iPad cannot wake a sleeping Mac. With the lid closed and no external display, the Mac sleeps anyway.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton iPhone ou ton iPad ne peut pas réveiller un Mac en veille. Capot fermé et sans écran externe, le Mac s’endort quand même."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your iPhone or iPad lends its microphone, its speaker and its screen. Maé always works on your Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton iPhone ou ton iPad prête son micro, son haut-parleur et son écran. Maé travaille toujours sur ton Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own relay": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton propre relais"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own relay…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton propre relais…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your relay cannot read what is sent: it stays encrypted up to this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton relais ne peut pas lire ce qui est envoyé : c’est chiffré jusqu’à ce Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your relay cannot read what is sent: it stays encrypted up to this Mac. The certificate renews by itself (valid until %@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton relais ne peut pas lire ce qui est envoyé : c’est chiffré jusqu’à ce Mac. Le certificat se renouvelle tout seul (valable jusqu’au %@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your relay does not answer. I keep trying.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton relais ne répond pas. Je réessaie toute seule."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your relay does not take information from the internet, so internet sources receive nothing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton relais ne propose pas l’entrée des informations depuis internet, donc les sources d’internet ne reçoivent rien."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your relay does not take information from the internet. Its operator can turn it on (RELAY_INBOUND_DOMAIN).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton relais ne propose pas l’entrée des informations depuis internet. La personne qui le gère peut l’activer (RELAY_INBOUND_DOMAIN)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your relay does not take information from the internet: this source has no address.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton relais ne propose pas l’entrée des informations depuis internet : cette source n’a pas d’adresse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your test": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton essai"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your words and Maé’s answers, so that she can find a conversation again when you ask her about it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tes mots et les réponses de Maé, pour qu’elle retrouve une conversation quand tu lui en parles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
